# KS stability gate (docs/KS_STABILITY.md S2): H2/STO-3G at 2.5 A, RKS b3lyp from hcore, is RKS -> UKS (triplet) unstable; the follow promotes to UKS and reaches the broken-symmetry minimum.
%begin_control
    basis       sto-3g
    calculation energy
    basis_type  cartesian
%end_control
%begin_scf
    scf_type        rhf
    guess           hcore
    max_cycles      200
    tol_energy      1.0e-10
    tol_density     1.0e-9
    save_checkpoint .false.
    stability_check .true.
    stability_follow .true.
%end_scf
%begin_dft
    grid        ultrafine
    exchange    b3lyp
    correlation lyp
%end_dft
%begin_geom
    coord_type  cartesian
    coord_units angstrom
    use_symm    .false.
%end_geom
%begin_coords
2
0 1
H 0 0 0
H 0 0 2.5
%end_coords
